WEBVTT

00:28.107 --> 00:29.347
<i>The Heavy Knight.</i>

00:29.427 --> 00:37.527
Heavy Knight

00:31.037 --> 00:37.527
<i>It is a class specialized in defense that 
draws enemy attacks to protect allies.</i>

00:38.577 --> 00:43.967
<i>But compared to other 
defensive classes, it lacks versatility.</i>

00:45.037 --> 00:49.447
<i>Its incredibly weak offensive abilities 
make it difficult to level up.</i>

00:52.707 --> 00:55.917
As a result

00:53.077 --> 00:54.617
<i>As a result...</i>

00:55.777 --> 00:59.747
<i>it's known as a truly 
unfortunate defective class.</i>

02:34.187 --> 02:37.977
<b>Episode 1\h\h\h\h\hElymas the Heavy Knight</b>

02:47.587 --> 02:52.147
<i>Every time I've learned 
or seen something...</i>

03:00.057 --> 03:04.637
<i>I've always felt like
 I already knew what it was.</i>

03:06.617 --> 03:10.557
<i>Huh? I get the sense 
I've seen this before.</i>

04:06.047 --> 04:08.317
Doppellusion!

04:07.277 --> 04:08.317
<b>Doppellusion</b>

04:09.597 --> 04:13.527
I'll show you what 
a Master Swordsman can do!

04:14.287 --> 04:17.037
Cold-As-Steel Cutter!

05:06.287 --> 05:07.927
<i>And today...</i>

05:09.277 --> 05:11.667
<i>I was about to undertake</i>

05:11.667 --> 05:14.647
<i>the vital Ritual of Divine Blessing 
as heir to the Edvaughn family.</i>

05:14.647 --> 05:16.127
It's finally time.

05:14.647 --> 05:16.617
I'm nervous, too.

05:16.617 --> 05:18.387
He's so gallant.

05:19.017 --> 05:22.047
<i>There's that odd feeling of déjà vu again.</i>

05:23.397 --> 05:25.027
It's all right, Elymas.

05:25.027 --> 05:28.897
You're my son. 
Have faith in the God of the Sword.

05:35.957 --> 05:38.007
Elymas Edvaughn.

05:44.037 --> 05:47.067
I grant you the divine 
blessing of a class.

05:49.427 --> 05:50.847
Baptisma.

05:49.537 --> 05:51.287
<b>Baptisma</b>

05:49.537 --> 05:51.287
<b>Baptisma</b>

05:52.617 --> 05:55.167
<i>I recognize this.</i>

05:55.167 --> 05:57.297
<i>Five years ago—no, before that...</i>

05:57.827 --> 06:00.757
<i>Before I was even born...</i>

06:02.837 --> 06:07.517
<i>I obsessively played an online 
VR game called </i>Magic World<i>,</i>

06:07.517 --> 06:10.367
<i>and this world is exactly like that!</i>

06:12.647 --> 06:15.957
<i>It's hard to believe, 
but I've been reincarnated.</i>

06:16.567 --> 06:20.687
<i>With everything I know about the game, 
I'm guaranteed happiness and success.</i>

06:21.147 --> 06:26.167
<i>If that's the case, 
I hope I get my favorite class.</i>

06:28.167 --> 06:31.837
<i>That broken class said to be 
the strongest in </i>Magic World<i>.</i>

06:42.017 --> 06:45.227
<b>Elymas Edvaughn</b>

06:42.017 --> 06:45.227
<b>Attack


Defense


Magic


Speed</b>

06:42.017 --> 06:44.557
<b>Equipment</b>

06:42.017 --> 06:45.137
<b>Skills</b>

06:45.227 --> 06:47.477
<b>Class Heavy Knight</b>

06:45.227 --> 06:47.477
<b>Elymas Edvaughn</b>

06:45.227 --> 06:47.477
<b>Attack</b>

06:45.227 --> 06:47.477
<b>Defense</b>

06:45.647 --> 06:46.847
<i>Yes!</i>

06:48.717 --> 06:51.437
I did it, Father! I'm a Heavy Knight!

06:52.517 --> 06:53.937
Wh-What...

06:54.417 --> 06:55.527
Father?

06:56.037 --> 06:57.967
What did you just say?!

06:57.967 --> 07:01.147
Master Swordsman, yes? 
That's what you said, yes?!

07:01.147 --> 07:02.067
What?

07:08.517 --> 07:10.997
<i>I mixed up my memories 
from my past and present!</i>

07:11.497 --> 07:14.867
<i>In this world, simple and powerful 
classes are celebrated,</i>

07:14.867 --> 07:17.507
<i>while technical classes that take time 
to blossom are regarded poorly.</i>

07:18.717 --> 07:22.957
<i>Their analysis and testing of classes 
must be lagging behind.</i>

07:23.847 --> 07:25.567
Actually, um...

07:25.567 --> 07:26.947
Show me.

07:29.267 --> 07:32.017
Heavy Knight? What's the meaning of this?!

07:32.547 --> 07:37.277
With low stats across the board 
and no decent attack skills, it's useless!

07:37.597 --> 07:40.527
Without a doubt, it's a defective class!

07:40.527 --> 07:42.357
Father, please calm down.

07:42.357 --> 07:44.117
It has the highest HP and Defense.

07:44.117 --> 07:46.867
I don't care about that!

07:57.017 --> 07:58.587
I'm glad this happened here.

07:58.587 --> 08:02.847
The Edvaughns would be ruined if 
we'd been publicly embarrassed like this.

08:25.077 --> 08:26.427
I almost didn't recognize her.

08:26.427 --> 08:28.287
She's so beautiful now.

08:29.077 --> 08:30.077
Who is she?

08:30.787 --> 08:32.297
She's beautiful.

08:32.587 --> 08:33.587
She's from a branch family.

08:33.587 --> 08:35.107
The daughter of a branch family, huh?

08:43.887 --> 08:49.367
I'm supposed to undergo the 
Ritual of Divine Blessing as well. May I?

08:46.157 --> 08:49.217
Who does she think she is?

08:49.217 --> 08:51.067
She should know her place.

08:51.067 --> 08:54.067
<i>She's the daughter 
of an Edvaughn branch family.</i>

08:54.067 --> 08:55.807
<i>Her name is Malice.</i>

08:56.517 --> 08:59.247
<i>We played together 
a few times as children,</i>

08:59.607 --> 09:04.827
<i>but in part due to her status, we've 
hardly spoken in the last five years.</i>

09:00.087 --> 09:02.267
They grow up so fast.

09:02.467 --> 09:04.447
She's so brazen.

09:07.497 --> 09:09.717
B-But currently...

09:09.717 --> 09:12.807
It's fine. Begin the ritual.

09:19.157 --> 09:21.337
<i>I've got a bad feeling about this.</i>

09:30.957 --> 09:32.597
Baptisma.

09:31.137 --> 09:32.597
<b>Baptisma</b>

09:31.137 --> 09:32.597
<b>Baptisma</b>

