<b>Class: Master Swordsman</b>

10:00.037 --> 10:00.167
<b>Malice Edvaughn</b>

10:00.167 --> 10:00.287
<b>Class: Master Swordsman</b>

10:00.167 --> 10:00.287
<b>Malice Edvaughn</b>

10:00.287 --> 10:01.667
<b>Class: Master Swordsman</b>

10:00.287 --> 10:01.667
<b>Malice Edvaughn</b>

10:02.487 --> 10:04.867
Master Swordsman, huh?

10:10.877 --> 10:12.947
Sorry.

10:13.687 --> 10:17.437
I seem to have taken all the skill.

10:17.917 --> 10:20.197
<i>My bad feeling came true.</i>

10:21.157 --> 10:24.377
<i>A branch family's daughter acquiring 
the Master Swordsman class</i>

10:24.377 --> 10:26.717
<i>could worsen my father's 
already terrible mood.</i>

10:31.697 --> 10:35.847
Splendid, Malice!
I knew you were a true Edvaughn.

10:35.847 --> 10:39.667
Malice, as of today, you are my daughter.

10:39.667 --> 10:41.957
You will be my heir.

10:43.897 --> 10:45.947
He named a branch family girl his heir?

10:48.357 --> 10:50.527
It's not as though it's without precedent.

10:50.527 --> 10:55.437
Father, I always thought
 that Lord Elymas... no.

10:56.687 --> 11:00.977
That <i>Elymas</i> could not bear 
the burden of being your heir.

11:01.477 --> 11:02.167
<i>What?</i>

11:02.167 --> 11:03.877
Begone, Elymas.

11:04.317 --> 11:08.547
You disappointed me. 
You are no longer my son!

11:08.547 --> 11:12.197
A Heavy Knight is a stain 
on the Edvaughns' reputation!

11:12.197 --> 11:14.957
Leave this mansion at once!

11:19.537 --> 11:21.547
It's the wise choice.

11:21.547 --> 11:22.557
Lord Elymas...

11:22.557 --> 11:24.687
It can't be helped.

11:23.797 --> 11:25.967
He's adopting the branch family girl?

11:24.717 --> 11:27.547
F-Father, surely you don't mean that!

11:28.017 --> 11:30.547
Heavy Knight is a strong class!

11:30.547 --> 11:31.747
I promise I'll bring honor to—

11:31.747 --> 11:33.067
Silence!

11:33.387 --> 11:35.737
This is exactly what you deserve!

11:35.737 --> 11:37.637
Don't show your face here again!

11:37.987 --> 11:40.697
Don't use the Edvaughn 
family name outside these walls.

11:40.697 --> 11:44.647
If you do, I'll have your head!

11:52.557 --> 11:53.567
Father!

11:57.667 --> 11:59.087
Clean this up.

12:21.677 --> 12:25.657
<i>My father refused to listen to me.</i>

12:22.807 --> 12:24.317
It's not much.

12:24.317 --> 12:24.967
It's fine.

12:24.967 --> 12:27.677
I'm sorry I couldn't do anything for you.

12:26.357 --> 12:32.607
<i>I was given a few coins and 
kicked out of the mansion that day.</i>

12:28.797 --> 12:29.907
Thank you.

12:31.677 --> 12:33.067
Lord Elymas?

13:22.707 --> 13:24.857
Should we recruit party members?

13:25.477 --> 13:28.197
Anyone will do, as long as 
they're a fast offensive class.

13:32.127 --> 13:33.467
How have you been?

13:33.897 --> 13:37.257
I'm planning to take on 
a promotion quest soon.

13:37.257 --> 13:39.667
I've got some pull with the examiners.

13:38.737 --> 13:40.317
Wow.

13:39.667 --> 13:41.597
Lord Teal's second to none!

13:45.357 --> 13:49.367
Today's the day! 
Today, I'll do my very best!

13:49.937 --> 13:51.167
Yeah!

13:51.567 --> 13:54.337
Just don't get in the way.

13:54.337 --> 13:56.827
I wish you could at least hunt normally.

14:11.767 --> 14:14.987
My husband's great 
in public, but at home...

14:14.987 --> 14:16.417
That's just men.

14:20.297 --> 14:22.887
<i>My piece of shit father 
put me through hell.</i>

14:24.027 --> 14:29.107
<i>I lost my home, my family, 
and my life, but...</i>

14:29.547 --> 14:32.857
<i>I've still got Heavy Knight, 
the strongest class.</i>

14:37.517 --> 14:39.027
<i>That said...</i>

14:39.347 --> 14:44.427
<i>This world's history, environment, 
and even this city's name of Rondalm,</i>

14:44.427 --> 14:46.667
<i>are nothing like the game.</i>

14:47.407 --> 14:50.207
<i>I'll have to do some research.</i>

14:52.607 --> 14:55.467
<i>First, I'll test my class and skills.</i>

