18:53.427 --> 18:55.477
<i>A level 2 Magic Stone.</i>

18:55.477 --> 18:57.607
<i>It's not worth much, 
but I'll hold onto it.</i>

19:02.537 --> 19:05.507
Help! Help me!

19:10.877 --> 19:14.017
Th-They're going to kill me!

19:15.247 --> 19:16.297
Are you an adventurer?

19:16.637 --> 19:18.987
P-Please help me!

19:30.787 --> 19:31.807
Let me handle this.

19:31.807 --> 19:33.177
What?

19:33.537 --> 19:36.037
Can you really take them?

19:36.757 --> 19:40.287
Are you actually a famous 
adventurer despite how you look?

19:41.037 --> 19:41.967
No.

19:42.837 --> 19:43.717
What?!

19:45.787 --> 19:49.677
I just leveled up 
for the first time in my life.

19:49.677 --> 19:52.677
Y-You're hopeless!

19:52.677 --> 19:55.677
You're way weaker than me!

19:55.677 --> 19:59.267
A newbie can't handle that many monsters.

19:59.597 --> 20:01.517
And take off that heavy armor!

20:02.367 --> 20:03.647
We have to run!

20:04.337 --> 20:06.567
<i>Rampart Reflection isn't perfect.</i>

20:07.537 --> 20:11.737
<i>Unless you negate all damage 
with a defense vastly superior</i>

20:12.597 --> 20:16.367
<i>to your opponent's attack, 
it doesn't activate.</i>

20:19.397 --> 20:20.537
Run!

20:24.357 --> 20:27.337
<i>It's ineffective against superior 
and unknown enemies.</i>

20:28.197 --> 20:29.277
<i>But...</i>

20:29.277 --> 20:32.137
Come at me! Rampart Reflection!

20:33.987 --> 20:35.367
What?!

20:39.967 --> 20:41.147
<b>Defense</b>

20:41.147 --> 20:43.737
<i>I'm already familiar with starter enemies.</i>

20:44.147 --> 20:48.297
<i>And I boosted my defense with 
skill tree bonuses and equipment.</i>

20:49.497 --> 20:51.197
<i>When it comes to fighting Raana...</i>

20:51.617 --> 20:54.447
<i>I can beat dozens of them!</i>

20:57.887 --> 20:59.827
What?!

21:08.057 --> 21:12.337
You beat that many Raana? Wh-Who are you?

21:13.837 --> 21:16.097
I'm Elymas Edvau...

21:16.097 --> 21:18.737
Don't use the Edvaughn family name 
outside these walls.

21:18.737 --> 21:22.517
If you do, I'll have your head!

21:22.977 --> 21:25.147
Sorry.

21:29.167 --> 21:30.027
No...

21:34.037 --> 21:37.437
I'm Elymas the Heavy Knight.

21:37.987 --> 21:39.997
I'm Elymas
 the Heavy Knight.

23:11.387 --> 23:15.127
<i>I won my first battle as a Heavy Knight.</i>

23:15.527 --> 23:19.007
<i>It's still the strongest class, 
just like it was in the game.</i>

23:19.517 --> 23:24.387
<i>But I need to level up to really shine.</i>

23:24.387 --> 23:27.187
<i>I can't waste time here.</i>

23:27.717 --> 23:32.777
<i>That's when a horrible monster 
double my level appears before me.</i>

23:32.777 --> 23:34.777
<i>Next time, "The Menacing Monkey Spider."</i>

23:35.027 --> 23:37.967
<i>This battle isn't unwinnable!</i>
